   "narrated": "Narrated `Aisha:",
   "text": "Allah's Messenger (ﷺ) said, \"Do good deeds properly, sincerely and moderately and know that your deeds will not make you enter Paradise, and that the most beloved deed to Allah is the most regular and constant even if it were little.\"",
